      "section": "Post service test",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 113.0,
        "t": 446.92,
        "r": 477.43,
        "b": 435.33
      },
      "content": "NOTE: If the toner cartridge was not removed prior to servicing the printer, remove it now."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_1868",
      "reading_order": 2460,
      "section": "Post service test",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 113.0,
        "t": 424.42,
        "r": 512.1700000000005,
        "b": 412.83
      },
      "content": "Release the support shaft (callout 1), and then slide it toward the center of the door (callout 2)."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_1869",
      "reading_order": 2461,
